==Battleground==
*10 [[Chief Peng]]s (100%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chief Peng]] (700%) spawns as the boss.
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The problem of this stage comes from the hyperbuffed Chief Peng, boasting a nightmarishly high DPS. This, combined with Gory Darks, gives the stage incredible pushing power. If you have [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]], this stage is essentially free, but otherwise it is recommended to utilize midranged Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to chip away at the enemies. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can stall them efficiently on lower crown difficulties, however it is recommended to use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to nuke the enemies on {{4c}} and lessen the burden.

